    "gallery.ctaLabel": "Start Your Custom Order",
    "gallery.ctaText": "Ready to create your own masterpiece?",
    "gallery.description": "Explore our portfolio of custom creations, each one unique and crafted with passion. From intimate celebrations to grand events, see how we bring visions to life.",
